exports[`compileBundle on the shop project returns the bundle, its manifest and BUNDLE.md as a snapshot: BUNDLE.md 1`] = `
"# Compiled bundle

Two layers for one proposed change, compiled against a base commit. Reply to the user in the user's language; never translate identifiers, invariant ids or business text.

- Layer \`target/\` is nestjs-ts: skeleton, packets, executor briefs and the module skill, for an executor in this repository. Only this layer is certified: a task is \`done\` only when \`verify\` says so.
- Layer \`neutral/\`: model, invariants with given/when/then examples, acceptance criteria and briefs with no TypeScript, for a team in any language. It is not certified: only the target layer is certified \`done\`.

- Bundle version: 1
- Base ref: \`<baseRef>\`
- Base lock hash: \`99f8849ee3d00aeda9202706323884a5514e84ffad84c3c3d828c3826f0b9edc\`
- Bundle hash: \`45527d9713aee39ad3331dcb9e103efc5743d262c4c2598e155fac62d06377ba\`

## Apply the bundle

Run from the base checkout, at the base ref above. It refuses on a base mismatch, writes the skeleton and runs \`compile\`. (requires \`agentic apply\`, issue #120: it does not exist yet)

\`\`\`bash
bun run agentic apply <path-to-this-bundle>
\`\`\`

## Items in wave order

Finish every item of a wave before the next. A task is complete only when \`verify\` returns \`done\`. The reviewer brief is not bundled: it is generated at review time from the diff and the gate results (\`bun scripts/orchestrate.ts\` renders it in the review step).

### Wave 1

- \`entity:Order\` (domain), executor brief: \`target/briefs/entity-Order.md\`
  \`\`\`bash
  bun run agentic packet entity:Order
  bun run agentic verify --item entity:Order --spec-hash 01bdc3919c88391c3c4ad85cb2c535b85451fe80d21d9e5e84ffb74cf8ca7c8b
  \`\`\`

### Wave 2

- \`method:Order.pay\` (domain), executor brief: \`target/briefs/method-Order-pay.md\`
  \`\`\`bash
  bun run agentic packet method:Order.pay
  bun run agentic verify --item method:Order.pay --spec-hash ad9064e22d5f240912d07146ff815837ba7ba2eb23dda8adc0a66d125346002d
  \`\`\`

- \`method:Order.refund\` (domain), executor brief: \`target/briefs/method-Order-refund.md\`
  \`\`\`bash
  bun run agentic packet method:Order.refund
  bun run agentic verify --item method:Order.refund --spec-hash c8617ba562d330858286b3b8f67784c89b3b4e4f5beff617c4d5773da30c0b63
  \`\`\`

### Wave 3

- \`usecase:pay_order\` (application), executor brief: \`target/briefs/usecase-pay_order.md\`
  \`\`\`bash
  bun run agentic packet usecase:pay_order
  bun run agentic verify --item usecase:pay_order --spec-hash 69a43b679712547c5929ccd839be47bdf2d900fc05862f35f5106c65fc4a2d6f
  \`\`\`
"
`;

